Error: Jet.MethodNamedCopyOrMove: A function can't be named `in_place`
  --> Tests/UI/E0436_function_named_in_place.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | in_place: fn(n: Int) -> Int { n + 1 }
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `x.in_place()` is the compiler's own write window onto a named value, so a function with that name would be shadowed at every call
 Fix: Rename the function and its calls, for example to `emit_in_place`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MethodNamedCopyOrMove
